{
  "_comment": "LMEB official metric conformance vectors for LMEBSpecMetrics.swift and lmeb_spec_metrics.rs. Both ports must produce identical numbers on every vector to within 1e-9. Values are hand-computed against metric.py (§A3) and verified by Python in the build log.",

